OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue warning over escaped
OL,4,Asex offender
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are searching for a sex offender
OL,7,Fwho escaped from a Lincolnshire prison.
OL,9,FJames Hands, 38, from Nottingham, was
OL,10,Freported missing from HMP North Sea
OL,11,FCamp in Boston on Tuesday.
OL,13,FLincolnshire Police said he had tattoos
OL,14,Fon his neck and hands and was serving a
OL,15,Fsentence for stalking and harassment.
OL,16,FThe force said he may have also changed
OL,17,Fhis appearance, such as shaving his
OL,18,Fface and or head, and is believed to
OL,19,Fhave travelled to the Nottingham area.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
